@startuml governance-domains
title AVS Governance Domains (CR-VAS-007)
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam roundCorner 10
skinparam shadowing false

rectangle "Governance" as Gov {
}

rectangle "G1\nSemantic" as G1
rectangle "G2\nAuthority" as G2
rectangle "G3\nOperational" as G3
rectangle "G4\nRisk &\nPolicy" as G4
rectangle "G5\nValue" as G5
rectangle "G6\nChange" as G6
rectangle "G7\nPortfolio" as G7

Gov --> G1
Gov --> G2
Gov --> G3
Gov --> G4
Gov --> G5
Gov --> G6
Gov --> G7

note bottom of Gov
  Governance is subordinate to the semantic model.
  7 governance domains + 6 governance dimensions.
end note

@enduml
